# Workflows + domain contracts

**Thesis:** Temporal = macro execution runtime. Deep Agents (LangChain) = cognition inside Temporal `operation.execute` activities. Domain contracts + application services = semantic authority. LangGraph checkpoint / LangSmith = evidence, not authority.

Defer coexistence philosophy → `agent-framework-coexistence.mdc`. Store/worker-pool → `tech-stack-authority.mdc`. Family package ownership → `wp-bp-010-stagegraph.mdc`, `wp-bp-020-goal-directed.mdc`. Meta IDs → `biotech-meta-reference.mdc` (manual). Do not paste SPEC matrices here.

## Layering

```text
Admit/compile (Postgres + ControlPlane)
  → BellLabsRunWorkflow (Temporal root)
    → StageGraphWorkflow | GoalDirectedWorkflow
      → OperationWorkflow
        → activity operation.execute
          → OperationExecutionService
            → DeepAgentRuntimeAdapter.create_deep_agent()  # sole production site
              → LangGraph checkpoint / LangSmith (evidence, not authority)
```

Interpreters **propose**; run-control **terminalizes**. Temporal never owns readiness/convergence semantics.

